flowchart TD
    Start([🎯 Client Onboarding<br/>Complete Flow]) --> CreateClient[1️⃣ Create Client<br/>POST /api/v1/clients<br/>• Company info<br/>• Contact details<br/>• Tax ID]
    
    CreateClient --> ClientCreated{Client<br/>Created?}
    
    ClientCreated -->|❌ Error| ClientError[Handle Error<br/>409: Duplicate<br/>400: Validation]
    
    ClientCreated -->|✅ Success| CreateClientUser[2️⃣ Create Client User<br/>POST /api/v1/clients/:id/users<br/>• Email<br/>• Portal access]
    
    CreateClientUser --> MagicLink[3️⃣ Magic Link Sent<br/>📧 Email with setup link<br/>Expires in 48h]
    
    MagicLink --> ClientActivates[4️⃣ Client Activates<br/>Clicks link → Sets password<br/>Accesses portal]
    
    ClientActivates --> CreateProject[5️⃣ Create Project<br/>POST /api/v1/projects<br/>• Project name<br/>• Linked to client<br/>• Budget & dates]
    
    CreateProject --> ProjectCreated{Project<br/>Created?}
    
    ProjectCreated -->|❌ Error| ProjectError[Handle Error<br/>409: Client not found]
    
    ProjectCreated -->|✅ Success| AssignTeam[6️⃣ Assign Team<br/>POST /api/v1/projects/:id/members<br/>• Developers<br/>• Project manager<br/>• Roles]
    
    AssignTeam --> ActivateProject[7️⃣ Activate Project<br/>PATCH /api/v1/projects/:id/status<br/>Status: DRAFT → ACTIVE]
    
    ActivateProject --> WorkBegins[8️⃣ Work Begins<br/>Team creates tickets<br/>Starts time tracking]
    
    WorkBegins --> CreateTickets[📝 Create Tickets<br/>POST /api/v1/tickets<br/>• Bug fixes<br/>• Features<br/>• Tasks]
    
    CreateTickets --> StartTimer[⏱️ Start Time Tracking<br/>POST /api/v1/time-tracking/start<br/>Linked to tickets]
    
    StartTimer --> DoWork[💻 Development Work<br/>Team completes tasks<br/>Timer running]
    
    DoWork --> StopTimer[⏱️ Stop Timer<br/>POST /api/v1/time-tracking/stop<br/>Duration calculated<br/>Marked as billable]
    
    StopTimer --> AccumulateHours[📊 Accumulate Billable Hours<br/>Multiple time entries<br/>Throughout project period]
    
    AccumulateHours --> ReadyToInvoice{Ready to<br/>Invoice?}
    
    ReadyToInvoice -->|Not yet| ContinueWork[Continue Work<br/>More tickets & time entries]
    
    ContinueWork --> DoWork
    
    ReadyToInvoice -->|Yes - Month end| CreateInvoice[9️⃣ Create Invoice<br/>POST /api/v1/accounting/invoices<br/>• Client ID<br/>• Project ID<br/>• Link time entries<br/>• Calculate amount]
    
    CreateInvoice --> InvoiceCreated{Invoice<br/>Created?}
    
    InvoiceCreated -->|❌ Error| InvoiceError[Handle Error<br/>422: Missing items]
    
    InvoiceCreated -->|✅ Success| IssueInvoice[🔟 Issue Invoice<br/>PATCH /api/v1/invoices/:id/issue<br/>Status: DRAFT → ISSUED<br/>PDF generated]
    
    IssueInvoice --> SendInvoice[📧 Send to Client<br/>Email with PDF<br/>Payment instructions]
    
    SendInvoice --> ClientReceives[1️⃣1️⃣ Client Receives<br/>Views in portal<br/>Checks details]
    
    ClientReceives --> ClientPays[1️⃣2️⃣ Client Pays<br/>Bank transfer or card<br/>External payment]
    
    ClientPays --> RecordPayment[1️⃣3️⃣ Record Payment<br/>POST /api/v1/accounting/payments<br/>• Invoice ID<br/>• Amount<br/>• Payment method<br/>• Date]
    
    RecordPayment --> PaymentProcessed{Payment<br/>Recorded?}
    
    PaymentProcessed -->|❌ Error| PaymentError[Handle Error<br/>422: Amount exceeds due<br/>409: Invoice already paid]
    
    PaymentProcessed -->|✅ Success| UpdateInvoice[1️⃣4️⃣ Invoice Updated<br/>Status: ISSUED → PAID<br/>paid_amount updated]
    
    UpdateInvoice --> LedgerEntries[1️⃣5️⃣ Ledger Entries<br/>Double-entry accounting:<br/>DEBIT: Bank<br/>CREDIT: Accounts Receivable]
    
    LedgerEntries --> NotifyFinance[1️⃣6️⃣ Notifications<br/>📧 Finance team<br/>📧 Project manager<br/>📱 Client confirmation]
    
    NotifyFinance --> Complete[🎉 COMPLETE<br/>Full Cycle:<br/>Client → Project → Work → Invoice → Payment]
    
    Complete --> NextCycle{Continue<br/>Next Month?}
    
    NextCycle -->|Yes| ContinueWork
    NextCycle -->|No| ProjectComplete[Project Completion<br/>PATCH /api/v1/projects/:id/status<br/>Status: ACTIVE → COMPLETED]
    
    ProjectComplete --> FinalReports[📊 Final Reports<br/>• Time tracking summary<br/>• Financial summary<br/>• Project KPIs]
    
    FinalReports --> End([✅ Client Lifecycle Complete])
    
    ClientError --> End
    ProjectError --> End
    InvoiceError --> End
    PaymentError --> End
    
    style Start fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1976d2,stroke-width:3px
    style Complete fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#388e3c,stroke-width:3px
    style End fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1976d2,stroke-width:3px
    style ClientError fill:#ffcdd2
    style ProjectError fill:#ffcdd2
    style InvoiceError fill:#ffcdd2
    style PaymentError fill:#ffcdd2